flow Stop payments at the daily budget

box agent as AI agent
box vi as VeriIntent
box signer as Signer

gauge budget as Daily budget [on: vi, limit: 100, unit: USDC, over: Stopped over the limit]

step Send the first
  say gauge places a gauge under the box that holds the amount, and set writes the total of the step.
  agent -> vi: 40 USDC
  vi -> signer: Ask to sign
  set budget: 40

step Send the second
  say A step that changes the value shows the change in a tag beside the bar.
  agent -> vi: 40 USDC
  vi -> signer: Ask to sign
  set budget: 80

step Stop at the third
  say The part over the limit grows in red, and the over text shows under the gauge.
  agent -> vi: 40 USDC
  set budget: 120
